{"v":5,"t":1792516230729,"slug":"nissan-gt-r-black-edition-r35-forza-edition-2012","build":{"carId":"NIS_GTRFE_12","slotOrder":["Engine","Intake","FuelSystem","Ignition","Exhaust","Camshaft","Valves","Displacement","PistonsCompression","Flywheel","OilCooling","TwinTurbo","Intercooler","Drivetrain","Clutch","Transmission","Driveline","Differential","Brakes","SpringDamper","AntiSwayFront","AntiSwayRear","WeightReduction","ChassisStiffness","TrackSpacingFront","TrackSpacingRear","TireCompound","TireWidthFront","TireWidthRear","FrontAspectRatio","RearAspectRatio","RimSizeFront","RimSizeRear","CarBody","FrontBumper","RearBumper","Hood","SideSkirts","RearWing"],"areas":[{"key":"engine","name":"Engine","desc":"Engine upgrades can improve your car's acceleration and speed. You can add a more aggressive cam, stiffer valve springs, improved intake, and exhaust systems as well as a turbo or supercharger to get more power out of your engine. Combine several engine upgrade types to get the most out of your engine. But remember: extra power alone will not win races. Winning performance calls for a balance between power and handling.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/engine_power_Icon.webp","slots":[{"slot":"Intake","label":"Intake","desc":"Intake upgrades help the engine inhale more freely and provide a lot of bang for the buck. Less restrictive air filters and a tuned intake manifold allow more air into the engine, making more power.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/intake_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/intake_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Intake","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/intake_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"FuelSystem","label":"Fuel System","desc":"Fuel system upgrades can yield big power increases. They provide more efficient fuel flow, more precise timing, the ability to use higher-octane fuel, and they extract more power from the fuel you use. These changes can be as simple as installing a custom Engine Control Unit (ECU) chip or as complex as changing the fuel pump and tank, injectors, and fuel hoses.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/fuel_system_injection_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/fuel_system_injection_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Fuel System","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/fuel_system_injection_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Ignition","label":"Ignition","desc":"Ignition upgrades help the engine burn fuel more efficiently to produce more power. Adding better coils, spark plugs, and ignition wiring can make a significant difference in engine power and car performance.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/ignition_electronic_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/ignition_electronic_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Ignition","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/ignition_electronic_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Exhaust","label":"Exhaust","desc":"Exhaust system upgrades such as improved headers, mufflers, bypasses, and large-bore tubing provide extra power for a relatively low cost. They let the engine exhale more freely and create more power by reducing back pressure and extracting exhaust gases more efficiently. These upgrades also make an audible difference.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/exhaust_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/exhaust_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Exhaust","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/exhaust_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Camshaft","label":"Camshaft","desc":"Upgraded cams let your engine breathe more freely and rev to higher RPM, producing more torque and power. The net result is a higher redline and more power in the high-RPM range.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/camshaft_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/camshaft_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Cams and Valves","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"redline_rpm":7000,"stall_rpm":800,"start_rpm":4320,"redline_wear_speed":0.01,"torque_curve_max_rpm":8000,"cut_throttle_rpm":35,"cut_throttle_time":0.05},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/camshaft_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Valves","label":"Valves","desc":"Valves allow the air and fuel mixture to enter and exit the engine. Upgrading these allows for more air flow increasing power.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/valves_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/valves_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Valves","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/valves_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Displacement","label":"Displacement","desc":"Displacement upgrades make the engine more durable and less damage-prone. They can also reduce friction/inertia and increase displacement/compression to make the engine more powerful and responsive.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/displacement_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/displacement_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Engine Block","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"disp":3799},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/displacement_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"PistonsCompression","label":"Pistons / Compression","desc":"Upgrading pistons allows for high-compression ratios increasing power.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/pistons_compression_FI_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/pistons_compression_FI_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Pistons / Compression","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/pistons_compression_NA_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"TwinTurbo","label":"Twin Turbo","desc":"A turbocharger provides a major power increase by using exhaust gases to spin a turbine which compresses the air-fuel mixture and forces it into the engine at more than atmospheric pressure. The result is more energy per stroke, which makes more power. These upgrades also make an audible difference. Two are usually better!","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/turbo_twin_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/turbo_twin_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Twin Turbo","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":18,"max_scale":1.4,"power_max_scale":114,"min_scale":0.885,"power_min_scale":10,"rob_scale":0.9286,"torque_drop_off_rpm0":9000,"torque_drop_off_rpm1":15000,"torque_drop_off_scale1":0.75},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/turbo_twin_LG_3.webp"},{"id":4312001,"tier":"Race Twin Turbo With Anti-Lag","level":4,"price":7200,"isStock":false,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":18,"off_throttle_moment_inertia":300,"max_scale":1.4,"power_max_scale":88,"min_scale":0.885,"power_min_scale":10,"rob_scale":0.9286,"torque_drop_off_rpm0":9000,"torque_drop_off_rpm1":15000,"torque_drop_off_scale1":0.75},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/turbo_twin_LG_4.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Intercooler","label":"Intercooler","desc":"An intercooler is a small radiator that cools the hot air from a turbocharger or supercharger before it is forced into the engine. This makes the air-fuel mixture cooler, and therefore more dense, packing more energy per stroke.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/intercooler_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/intercooler_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Intercooler","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/intercooler_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"OilCooling","label":"Oil / Cooling","desc":"Adding oil cooling keeps the engine's oil at the correct temperature, aiding efficiency and increasing power.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/oil_cooling_system_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/oil_cooling_system_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Oil / Cooling","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/oil_cooling_system_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Flywheel","label":"Flywheel","desc":"For a stock car, the rotating mass of the flywheel smoothes and steadies the rotation of the driveshaft, but it decreases throttle response and acceleration. Upgrading to a lighter-weight flywheel allows the engine to respond to the throttle more quickly and increase RPM faster, providing better acceleration.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/flywheel_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/flywheel_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4312000,"tier":"Race Flywheel","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":0.1193},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Engine_Power/flywheel_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0}]},{"key":"platform-handling","name":"Platform and Handling","desc":"Platform and handling upgrades include better brakes and suspension. Combine several platform and handling upgrade types to get the most out of your chassis. These upgrades add up to better braking and cornering. But remember: race-winning performance calls for a balance between handling and power.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/platform_handling_Icon.webp","slots":[{"slot":"Brakes","label":"Brakes","desc":"Brakes are an important part of the total performance picture. To be competitive, your car's brake performance must match its power and handling. Leading the pack at the end of a straight won't help if you can't slow down fast enough to make the next turn. These upgrades increase braking power and decrease brake fade due to excessive heat.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/brakes_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/brakes_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Race Brakes","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"front_brake_size":15,"front_brake_size_mm":390,"front_brake_rotor_thickness_mm":35,"front_brake_drum_depth_mm":65,"front_brake_non_spinning_mass":4,"front_brake_type_id":3,"front_caliper_pistons":6,"rear_brake_size":14,"rear_brake_size_mm":380,"rear_brake_rotor_thickness_mm":35,"rear_brake_drum_depth_mm":65,"rear_brake_non_spinning_mass":4,"rear_brake_type_id":3,"rear_caliper_pistons":4,"game_friction_scale_braking":1.17,"brake_torque_slider":0.5,"brake_bias_slider":0.5,"release_point_abs":0.71,"front_brake_torque_clamp":250,"rear_brake_torque_clamp":250},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/brakes_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"SpringDamper","label":"Spring and Dampers","desc":"Springs and dampers can make a big difference in your car's handling by maintaining optimum ride height and tire contact.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/springs_dampers_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/springs_dampers_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Race Spring and Dampers","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"suspension_damage_mod_def_id":9,"tires_damage_mod_def_id":8,"front_spring_damper_physics_id":4167003,"rear_spring_damper_physics_id":4167103,"steer_max_angle":37,"steer_max_angle_filtered":29},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/springs_dampers_LG_3.webp"},{"id":4167004,"tier":"Rally Spring and Dampers","level":4,"price":2050,"isStock":false,"mfr":"Nissan","stats":{"mass_diff":-0.6498,"suspension_damage_mod_def_id":9,"tires_damage_mod_def_id":8,"front_spring_damper_physics_id":4167004,"rear_spring_damper_physics_id":4167104,"steer_max_angle":37,"steer_max_angle_filtered":29},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/springs_dampers_LG_3.webp"},{"id":4167005,"tier":"Drift Spring and Dampers","level":5,"price":2050,"isStock":false,"mfr":"Nissan","stats":{"suspension_damage_mod_def_id":9,"tires_damage_mod_def_id":8,"front_spring_damper_physics_id":4167005,"rear_spring_damper_physics_id":4167105,"steer_max_angle":50,"steer_max_angle_filtered":50},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/springs_dampers_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"AntiSwayFront","label":"Front Anti-roll Bars","desc":"Front anti-roll bars (also called anti-sway bars) provide extra stability when cornering. When you turn left or right, the car body tends to roll in the opposite direction. By tying the left and right sides of the suspension together, anti-sway bars make the car ride more level and keep one side from rolling or swaying more than the other.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/anti_roll_bars_front_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/anti_roll_bars_front_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Race Front Anti-roll Bars","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"anti_sway_physics_id":4167003},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/anti_roll_bars_front_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"AntiSwayRear","label":"Rear Anti-roll Bars","desc":"Rear anti-roll bars (also called anti-sway bars) provide extra stability when cornering. When you turn left or right the car body tends to roll in the opposite direction. By tying the left and right sides of the suspension together, anti-sway bars make the car ride more level, keeping one side from rolling or swaying more than the other.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/anti_roll_bars_rear_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/anti_roll_bars_rear_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Race Rear Anti-roll Bars","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"anti_sway_physics_id":4167103},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/anti_roll_bars_rear_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"ChassisStiffness","label":"Chassis Reinforcement / Roll Cage","desc":"Chassis reinforcements stiffen the shell of the car, reducing flex when cornering, which in turn aid the suspension in keeping the maximum amount of tire on the road.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/chassis_reinforcement_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/chassis_reinforcement_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167002,"tier":"Sport Chassis Reinforcement / Roll Cage","level":2,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"front_lat_friction_scale":0.995,"rear_lat_friction_scale":0.995,"front_long_friction_scale":0.995,"rear_long_friction_scale":2},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/chassis_reinforcement_LG_2.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"WeightReduction","label":"Weight Reduction","desc":"A lighter car accelerates and handles better than a heavier one. Reducing weight by removing nonessential materials or replacing stock parts with lighter ones pays off on the track.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/weight_reduction_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/weight_reduction_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167003,"tier":"Race Weight Reduction","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"mass":1805,"initial_mass":1805,"cm_height":0.4,"cm_back_front":0.53,"cm_left_right":0.5,"block_dim_x":2.0845,"block_dim_y":0.915,"block_dim_z":4.9035},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Platform_Handling/weight_reduction_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0}]},{"key":"drivetrain","name":"Drivetrain","desc":"Change how the engine's power gets to the wheels to improve your cars acceleration and speed. Upgrades to components such as the transmission, clutch, differentials, and driveline can improve shift time and enable fine-tuning of gearing.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/drivetrain_Icon.webp","slots":[{"slot":"Clutch","label":"Clutch","desc":"The clutch is the vital link between the engine and the transmission. Upgrades increase the clutch's ability to handle the extra torque of a racing engine without damage.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/clutch_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/clutch_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4245000,"tier":"Race Clutch","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"clutch_in_time":0.02,"clutch_out_time":0.02},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/clutch_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Transmission","label":"Transmission","desc":"The transmission transmits you car's power from the engine to the drive wheels. Transmission upgrades can make shifts quicker and more efficient, reduce friction and power loss, and provide better durability. These upgrades also make an audible difference.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/transmission_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/transmission_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4245000,"tier":"Race Transmission","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":0.0098,"gear_shift_time":0.02,"final_drive_ratio":2.2,"num_gears":6,"gear_ratio1":2.5,"gear_ratio2":1.6,"gear_ratio3":1.18,"gear_ratio4":0.94,"gear_ratio5":0.78},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/transmission_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Driveline","label":"Driveline","desc":"You can improve throttle response and acceleration by decreasing the weight and inertia of driveline components, especially the driveshaft itself.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/driveline_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/driveline_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4245000,"tier":"Race Driveline","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":0.039,"flex_max_angle":720,"flex_spring_min":1500,"flex_spring_max":15000,"flex_damper_min":0.15,"flex_damper_max":0.15,"flex_damper_min_offroad":0.4,"flex_damper_max_offroad":0.4,"flex_spring_min_wheel_torque":20,"flex_spring_max_wheel_torque":1500},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/driveline_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Differential","label":"Differential","desc":"The differential allows the tires on each side of the car to turn at different rates because the inside tire travels a shorter distance around a turn than the outside tire. A limited-slip differential locks at a preset point to limit this difference in rotational speed, providing maximum traction under acceleration and/or deceleration.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/diff_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/diff_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4245000,"tier":"Race Diff","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":"Stock","stats":{"rear_limited_slip_torque_accel":0.3,"rear_limited_slip_rel_vel_clamp":60,"rear_limited_slip_accel_def_input_torque":0.3,"tc_profile_id":3,"differential_profile_id":3},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/diff_LG_3.webp"},{"id":4245005,"tier":"Rally Diff","level":5,"price":2500,"isStock":false,"mfr":"Nissan","stats":{"rear_limited_slip_torque_accel":0.875,"rear_limited_slip_torque_decel":0.1,"rear_limited_slip_rel_vel_clamp":60,"rear_limited_slip_accel_def_input_torque":0.3,"rear_toque_split":0.6,"tc_profile_id":4,"differential_profile_id":4},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/diff_LG_3.webp"},{"id":4245006,"tier":"Drift Diff","level":6,"price":2500,"isStock":false,"mfr":"Nissan","stats":{"rear_limited_slip_torque_accel":0.975,"rear_limited_slip_rel_vel_clamp":60,"rear_limited_slip_accel_def_input_torque":0.3,"rear_toque_split":0.8,"tc_profile_id":5,"differential_profile_id":5},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/diff_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0}]},{"key":"tires-rims","name":"Tires and Rims","desc":"You cannot transmit your cars power and handling potential to the road without the right tires and rims. The stock tires on your car limit your track performance, no matter how you tweak your engine or suspension. Upgrading rims and tire compound, size, and profile improves cornering and braking performance.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tires_rims_Icon.webp","slots":[{"slot":"TireCompound","label":"Tire Compound","desc":"Upgrading to tires with a softer, more aggressive compound increases traction and improves the tires ability to maintain traction despite high heat, but also increases wear. The harder compound used in stock tires sacrifices grip to increase wear. These upgrades also make an audible difference.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tire_compound_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tire_compound_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Drag Tire Compound","level":9,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"tire_compound_id":14,"tire_model_name":"Slick_FE","wet_tire_model_name":"Slick_FE","front_tire_pressure":19,"rear_tire_pressure":18},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"TireWidthFront","label":"Front Tire Width","desc":"In general, more rubber on the road means better traction and performance. Upgrading to larger, wider tires provides more contact area and thus more traction. You can use wider normal-profile tires to improve traction by enlarging the tires contact patch on the pavement. Or you can choose larger rims and low-profile tires with shorter, more rigid sidewalls. These tires are less prone to deforming as acceleration and cornering forces increase. This improves traction by maintaining tread contact with the pavement.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tire_width_Icon_front.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tire_width_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Front Tire Width","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"front_tire_width":125},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"TireWidthRear","label":"Rear Tire Width","desc":"In general, more rubber on the road means better traction and performance. Upgrading to larger, wider tires provides more contact area and thus more traction. You can use wider normal-profile tires to improve traction by enlarging the tires contact patch on the pavement. Or you can choose larger rims and low-profile tires with shorter, more rigid sidewalls. These tires are less prone to deforming as acceleration and cornering forces increase. This improves traction by maintaining tread contact with the pavement.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tire_width_Icon_rear.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tire_width_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Rear Tire Width","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"rear_tire_width":450},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"RimSizeFront","label":"Front Rim Size","desc":"Choose larger rims and low-profile tires with shorter, more rigid sidewalls. These tires are less prone to deforming as acceleration and cornering forces increase. This improves traction by maintaining tread contact with the pavement.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/rim_size_Icon_front.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/rim_size_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Front Rim Size","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"front_wheel_diameter":16},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"RimSizeRear","label":"Rear Rim Size","desc":"Choose larger rims and low-profile tires with shorter, more rigid sidewalls. These tires are less prone to deforming as acceleration and cornering forces increase. This improves traction by maintaining tread contact with the pavement.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/rim_size_Icon_back.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/rim_size_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Rear Rim Size","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"rear_wheel_diameter":13},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"TrackSpacingFront","label":"Front Track Width","desc":"A wider spacing between the front tires can provide additional stability under lateral G force.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/track_width_icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Front Track Width","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"TrackSpacingRear","label":"Rear Track Width","desc":"A wider spacing between the rear tires can provide additional stability under lateral G force.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/track_width_icon_back.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Rear Track Width","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"FrontAspectRatio","label":"Front Tire Profile Size","desc":"Increase or decrease the front wheel size.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tyre_aspect_icon_front.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tyre_aspect_icon_front.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Tire Profile Size","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"RearAspectRatio","label":"Rear Tire Profile Size","desc":"Increase or decrease the rear wheel size.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tyre_aspect_icon_back.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Tire_Rims/tyre_aspect_icon_back.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Rear Tire Profile Size","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0}]},{"key":"aero-appearance","name":"Aero and Appearance","desc":"Weight and aerodynamic upgrades can improve your cars acceleration, speed, downforce, and cornering, but to get ahead on the race track you have to balance your upgrades. A lightweight, streamlined car that is short on power or handling won't win races.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/aero_appearance_Icon.webp","slots":[{"slot":"FrontBumper","label":"Front Bumper","desc":"You can upgrade your front bumper to increase the load over the front wheels by increasing downforce. These upgrades allow higher cornering speeds. Note that Race upgrades make downforce adjustable.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/front_bumper_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/front_bumper_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Front Bumper","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"parts_string_id":"0"},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"RearWing","label":"Rear Wing","desc":"Upgrading the rear wing on your car increases the load over the rear wheels by generating downforce to allow higher cornering speeds. Note that Race upgrades make downforce adjustable.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/rear_wing_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/rear_wing_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Rear Wing","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"parts_string_id":"0"},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"RearBumper","label":"Rear Bumper","desc":"Rear bumper upgrades improve handling by decreasing lift at high speeds. The Level 3 upgrade also increases the load over the rear wheels by adding adjustable downforce. These changes allow higher cornering speeds.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/rear_bumper_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/rear_bumper_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Rear Bumper","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"parts_string_id":"0"},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"SideSkirts","label":"Side Skirts","desc":"Adding modified side skirts reduces weight and drag to improve overall performance.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/side_skirts_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/side_skirts_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Side Skirts","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"parts_string_id":"0"},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Hood","label":"Hood","desc":"Upgrading to a lighter-weight hood reduces overall weight and balance to improve performance.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/hood_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Aero_Appearance/hood_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Hood","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"parts_string_id":"0"},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0}]},{"key":"body-kits-conversions","name":"Body Kits and Conversions","desc":"Change major components of your car, altering its very nature.  Conversions affect the upgrades that are available in other categories.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Conversion/conversion_Icon.webp","slots":[{"slot":"Engine","label":"Engine Swap","desc":"You can swap in a new engine to get more power and possibly reduced weight, but every engine has its own upgrade path. Any upgrades on your current engine will not apply to the new engine. As a result, your car's power may actually decrease with an engine swap. Even with a new, more powerful engine, you may not win races. Winning performance calls for a balance between power and handling. An engine swap also makes an audible difference.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Conversion/conversion_engine_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Conversion/conversion_engine_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Powertrain Swap","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":"Evolve","stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Drivetrain","label":"Drivetrain Swap","desc":"You can swap an entirely new drivetrain into your car to get different driving characteristics and possibly reduced weight, but every drivetrain has its own upgrade path. Any upgrades on your current drivetrain will not apply to the new drivetrain. As a result, your car's handling may actually decrease with a drivetrain swap. Even with an upgraded drivetrain, you may not win races. Winning performance calls for a balance between power and handling.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Conversion/conversion_drivetrain_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Conversion/conversion_drivetrain_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":4167000,"tier":"Stock Drivetrain","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":null,"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"CarBody","label":"Body Kit","desc":"You can significantly alter your car's body work and stance for a bold new look, different driving characteristics, and possibly reduced weight. Some upgrades on your car's current body will not apply to the new body kit. As a result, your car's handling may actually decrease. Even with a body kit, you may not win races. Winning performance calls for a balance between 